    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88533" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσανάγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰγ]</span>, 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτ-</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carry up to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς φάος ἐκ βυθίας ποτανάγαγον ἰλύος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
					161
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be drawn up</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαγ-</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> seemingly
			intr., <i>come up to, approach</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαγαγοῦσαν</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.564c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῇ γῇ</span>
			<i>approached</i> the land, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
